            </div>
        </div>

        <div id="tab-portfolio" class="tab-content hidden">
            <div class="mb-4 sm:mb-6"><h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-semibold text-white">持仓组合诊断</h2><p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">全面分析您的投资组合风险与收益</p></div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-3 sm:gap-4 mb-4 sm:mb-6">
                <div class="glass-card rounded-xl p-3 sm:p-5 text-center"><p class="text-slate-400 text-xs sm:text-sm mb-1 sm:mb-2">综合评分</p><p id="portfolio-score" class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-400 to-pink-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">--</p></div>
